      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lolo%2C_Montana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 2017 Lolo Peak Fire burned thousands of acres southwest of town, forcing evacuations and closing U.S. Highway 12 for weeks.",
